@base_url = http://localhost:8080

### Get All Email Open
GET {{base_url}}/api/email-open

### Get Email Open by ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/email-open/1

### Create Email Open
POST {{base_url}}/api/email-open
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1001,
  "idAccount": 5,
  "openDate": "2026-01-15",
  "openTimestamp": "2026-01-15T10:30:00"
}

### Update Email Open
PUT {{base_url}}/api/email-open/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1001,
  "idAccount": 5,
  "openDate": "2026-01-20",
  "openTimestamp": "2026-01-20T11:00:00"
}

### Delete Email Open
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/email-open/1001

### Get Email Open by Account ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/email-open/account/5